**TDD Hardening Agent for Grok native paths (strict no-execution version, 2026-05-18 replacement):** Performed the assigned TDD hardening using exclusively list_dir/read_file/grep/search_replace (zero terminal/execution commands of any kind). Added 5 high-quality pure hermetic tests in existing modules (agent/src/tests/mod.rs , acp_thread/src/acp_thread.rs) covering exactly: is_grok_build_profile detection/guard (via injectable Fake x_ai grok models + flag asserts), GrokMemoryArtifacts + loading/injection (injectable _with + default), Todo/Monitor/Enter registration + P4-0 schema fidelity (has_registered + serde on content/status shapes), AgentCapabilityMode/persona prop in native spawn (new_subagent + getters), Plan::is_proposed + approval_risk on Grok tools (pending plans + named risks Destructive). Modeled on G-17 injectable patterns, full words, no summary comments in .rs, proper handling. All RO classified exploration first; PD only on test/docs appends. Updated this AGENTS + PLAN with findings. Delivers strong coverage for native Grok without TUI interruptions. Status: hardened. (Appended after table row G-07 per living doc pattern; respects all CLAUDE rules.)
**ZT-1 Native Grok Profile TDD Agent (2026-05-19, P3 highest priority slice):** As the ZT-1 Native Grok Profile TDD Agent, delivered hermetic TDD specifically for the ZT-1 classified persistent Todos surface (approvals, proposed plans, monitors, memory) appearing under the grok profile (`is_grok_build_profile` true) in native threads, matching ACP bridged path quality. RO-first protocol (zero terminal commands, 40+ list_dir/read_file/grep on existing test file crates/agent/src/tests/mod.rs + supporting agent thread/tools/acp_thread/PLAN/AGENTS/CLAUDE/thread_view for patterns; every step explicitly RO classified before tool use); PD only final minimal append (1 new test fn) to *existing test file only* per directive (no new files created). The added test uses injectable patterns (ToolCallEventStream::test(), direct EnterPlanModeTool/ GrokPlanItem construction, cx.update for Plan wrapper construction from emitted acp::Plan, TestAppContext + init_test mirroring existing grok/enter tests, Fake model patterns for profile). Covers exactly: risk classification (Destructive for todo_write/enter_plan_mode/monitor + proposed plan operation via approval_risk_for_* fns), proposed plan banner (is_proposed() true on acp_thread::Plan built from native shim emitted plan with all-Pending entries), actions (risk labels for Allow/Accept/Deny in surface), integration with native plan tools (EnterPlanModeTool + TodoWriteTool run emitting the Plan data that feeds ZT-1 when native Thread + x_ai grok model active via profile guard + fragments). Full words for all locals, no organizational/summary comments added to .rs (per CLAUDE), no unwrap/let_= /panic/index on fallible, proper ?/expect handling, correctness first. Enables native Grok Build in Zed UI to deliver the full ZT-1 UX win. Updated AGENTS table ZT-1 row + this log + PLAN last updated. All rules (CLAUDE, RO/PD explicit, existing files, no creative, Linux implicit) followed exactly. Status: TDD slice complete.
