- Monitor: cd required; possible real omits or uses alt name.
- Spawn: persona/capability_mode present (matches "spawn with persona/capability_mode").
- Missing: "id" in GrokPlanItem (PLAN notes "id/content/status" for P4 todo_write), get_command_or_subagent_output tool, active_form rename/casing, schema exact match to binary's registered defs (harness samples proxy only).
