- `crates/project/src/agent_server_store.rs` near the Windows `todo!` and `discover_grok_command_with`.
- `crates/agent/src/thread.rs` in `build_completion_request` (Grok fragments) and `enabled_tools` (monitor/todo_write shims).
- `crates/agent/src/agent.rs` (native session flavor).
