**Binding Auditor extensions for all P4 work**:
- Grok fragment or schema shims must be behind `is_grok_build_profile()` guard + static data; any hot-path alloc requires before/after token + latency measurement + TDD.
- Monitor scheduler updates must flow only through existing `ToolCall` event paths; never cause work when `!expanded`.
